  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow parsing a remote EIR name\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-80186.patch: clamp the name length to\n       HCI_MAX_NAME_LENGTH in name2utf8() in src/eir.c before copying it\n       into the fixed-size stack buffer.\n     - CVE-2026-80186\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow in AVRCP ListPlayerAttributes\n     response handling\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-85218.patch: validate the AVRCP header and\n       params_len against the received bytes and clamp the attribute count\n       to AVRCP_ATTRIBUTE_LAST in avrcp_list_player_attributes_rsp() in\n       profiles/audio/avrcp.c.\n     - CVE-2026-85218",
